The AI Style Atlas by Futurepedia (https://www.futurepedia.io/resources/ai-style-atlas/view) states no license.

This skill copies no text, prompts, images or clips from the atlas. It lists style names as facts and links back to each source entry. Every description and recipe is written in our own words for Subclip.

This adaptation needs the creator's confirmation. Until Futurepedia confirms, treat the license as "Not stated". Contact the maintainers to request removal at any time.
